{{/*
Render aggregate statistics for a metric recorded once per partition at teardown.

Fields:
* `sum` (int): Total across all partitions.
* `mean` (float): Mean per partition.
* `min` (int): Minimum value across partitions.
* `max` (int): Maximum value across partitions.
* `partition_count` (int): Number of partitions observed.

Corresponding Rust type: `AggregatedSingleValue`
*/}}
<div class="aggregated-single-value">
    {{ template "scalar" (dict "label" "sum" "value" .sum) }}
    {{ template "scalar" (dict "label" "mean" "value" .mean) }}
    {{ template "scalar" (dict "label" "min" "value" .min) }}
    {{ template "scalar" (dict "label" "max" "value" .max) }}
    {{ template "scalar" (dict "label" "n" "value" .partition_count) }}
</div>
